# A journal that a storage fault quarantined is never opened again, also
# when the fault was transient and the world did not park the store. The
# "storage dead" excuse covers only a store the world parked for a detected
# corruption, so the node that stays down on its own must not be excused.
excuse: node: storage dead
file: crates/lib/paros-roles/src/node/journals.rs
--- find
            .filter(|(_, since)| now.saturating_sub(**since) >= quarantine_ticks.max(1))
--- replace
            .filter(|(_, since)| now.saturating_sub(**since) >= u64::MAX)
--- end
